{"item_id": "feed:https://soldiersystems.net/2026/10/14/iai-and-sig-sauer-announce-successful-firing-test-of-fire-storm-250-airborne-machine-gun/?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=iai-and-sig-sauer-announce-successful-firing-test-of-fire-storm-250-airborne-machine-gun", "version_id": "0d4085205f9c545e13e8b2ba01ab78e43c4f9b975f59bcae85986f146bc47267", "decision": "reject", "reason": "Under the Exclusions and Relevance rules, this covers a weapon station mounted on a drone with an M250 machine gun, which is firearm content outside the non-firearm scope. It is also a sponsored manufacturer press release, a promotional post with no substantive independent evidence, and unconnected to Mammoth competitor gear.", "piece_ids": []}
